{
  "status": "ok",
  "application": "cac portfolio"
}

Test each application instance individually
Run:

for service in app1 app2 app3; do

  echo "--- $service ---"

  docker compose exec -T "$service" node -e \
  "fetch('http://127.0.0.1:3000/health').then(async r => { console.log(r.status, await r.text()); process.exit(r.ok ? 0 : 1) }).catch(e => { console.error(e); process.exit(1) })"

done

This checks the health endpoint inside each container.
